m>fine-tuning</em>. During this process, the model is fine-tuned in a super=
vised way =E2=80=94 that is, using human-annotated labels =E2=80=94 on a gi=
ven task.</p> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-10pkbfq">An example of a task is p=
