e-1tprb2h">This pretraining is usually done on very large amounts of data. =
Therefore, it requires a very large corpus of data, and training can take u=
p to several weeks.</p> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-8g0g1c"><em>Fine-tuning<=
/em>, on the other hand, is the training done <strong>after</strong> a mode=
