rstanding of the language you are using for your task).</li> <li>Since the =
pretrained model was already trained on lots of data, the fine-tuning requi=
res way less data to get decent results.</li> <li>For the same reason, the =
amount of time and resources needed to get good results are much lower.</li=
></ul> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-26kq7y">For example, one could leverage a=
