ecific attention to certain words in the sentence you passed it (and more o=
r less ignore the others) when dealing with the representation of each word=
.</p> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-cyn048">To put this into context, consider=
 the task of translating text from English to French. Given the input =E2=
=80=9CYou like this course=E2=80=9D, a translation model will need to also =
attend to the adjacent word =E2=80=9CYou=E2=80=9D to get the proper transla=
