=9Clike=E2=80=9D is conjugated differently depending on the subject. The re=
st of the sentence, however, is not useful for the translation of that word=
. In the same vein, when translating =E2=80=9Cthis=E2=80=9D the model will =
also need to pay attention to the word =E2=80=9Ccourse=E2=80=9D, because =
=E2=80=9Cthis=E2=80=9D translates differently depending on whether the asso=
ciated noun is masculine or feminine. Again, the other words in the sentenc=
e will not matter for the translation of =E2=80=9Ccourse=E2=80=9D. With mor=
